WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:06.040
Looking for a shift? The open spots board shows every game that still needs help.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:12.224
Tap Open spots on your volunteer page. Filter by sport with the buttons at the top.

00:00:12.424 --> 00:00:18.825
The calendar shows each game. The number is how many spots are still open. A check mark means it's full.

00:00:19.025 --> 00:00:23.335
Green is full, orange is half or more filled, and red is under half.

00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:30.310
Want to work with a friend? Type their first and last name to see stands with open spots where they're signed up.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.953
Tap a game to see its stands.

00:00:33.153 --> 00:00:39.703
Each circle is a spot. Green is filled, dashed is open, and a purple ring needs an alcohol permit.

00:00:39.903 --> 00:00:46.080
Ready? Tap Sign up for a spot. It opens that game's sign-up sheet, where you pick your spot.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:52.890
Games needing help lists the games with the most open spots. Tap one to jump to it.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:01:00.790
Once you sign up, the shift shows on your volunteer page. Make sure your paperwork is in before your first shift.
